<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.C. Penney upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.C. Penney upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said it upgraded J.C. Penney Co Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- the analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- the stock's opening was delayed on the NYSE due to an order imbalance. It closed Thursday at 54-3/16.</p>
</text>
